  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/863/674/logo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"182\" height=\"182\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">Система снятия коры с дерева для TFC</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">Используя топор, срубаем дерево и получаем кору</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">&nbsp;– Мы добываем кору с каждого дерева</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">&nbsp;– из коры можно изготовить коричневую пудру<br></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;– совместимость с модами Create: фрезеровка и резка, а также Farmers Delight<br><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1342/40/stripp-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1782\" height=\"972\"><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">---------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br>ПОПРОБУЙТЕ ДРУГИЕ МОДЫ 1.20.1 и 1.21.1 для TFC<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight-tfc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/247/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"Debark TFC\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><strong style=\"font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-lumberjack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/251/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/corals-tfc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/249/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-ore-washing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/250/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-more-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/252/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spindles-tfc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/253/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-better-stone-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1361/261/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-metal-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1361/263/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-muskets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1361/262/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><br>...</span></strong></span><br></span></p>",
